                          "name": "scriptH1",
                          "fill": "#0f172a",
                          "content": "## 1. オープニング",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 14,
                          "fontWeight": "700"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "qld8w",
                          "name": "scriptLine1",
                          "fill": "#374151",
                          "content": "[speaker:zundamon] えっと、今日は何の話をするのだ？",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "TpIiD",
                          "name": "scriptLine2",
                          "fill": "#374151",
                          "content": "[speaker:metan] 今日は「ReScript」というプログラミング言語を紹介しますよ。",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "i4H2w",
                          "name": "scriptLine3",
                          "fill": "#374151",
                          "content": "[speaker:zundamon] りすくりぷと！ 名前は聞いたことあるような気がするのだ。",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "PE9Pg",
                          "name": "scriptLine4",
                          "fill": "#374151",
                          "content": "[speaker:metan] まだあまり広くは知られていない言語ですが、使ってみると「型安全ってこういうことか」と腑に落ちる体験ができる言語なんです。",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "2MbVP",
                          "name": "scriptH2",
                          "fill": "#0f172a",
                          "content": "## 2. JavaScriptの限界",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 14,
                          "fontWeight": "700"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "9Un1T",
                          "name": "scriptLine5",
                          "fill": "#374151",
                          "content": "[speaker:metan] まずは土台の話から。今のWebアプリ開発ではJavaScriptが欠かせません。",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "n5JNb",
                          "name": "scriptLine6",
                          "fill": "#374151",
                          "content": "[speaker:zundamon] そうなのだ。JavaScriptはよく聞くのだ。",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "CKsKp",
                          "name": "scriptFade",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "height": 40,
                          "fill": "#ffffff"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
